# Project Structure & Architecture

## Overview
SAFE AI [4U] is a Next.js 15.3.4 professional website for an AI company focused on responsible and ethical AI solutions.

## Core Technologies
- **Framework**: Next.js 15.3.4 with TypeScript
- **Styling**: Tailwind CSS v4 with @theme inline directive
- **UI Components**: shadcn/ui (Radix UI primitives)
- **Animations**: Framer Motion 12.19.2
- **Forms**: React Hook Form with Zod validation
- **Color System**: OKLCH color space for cyberpunk theming

## File Structure
```
src/
├── app/                    # Next.js App Router pages
│   ├── globals.css        # Main theming system (cyberpunk colors)
│   ├── layout.tsx         # Root layout with navigation and error boundary
│   ├── page.tsx           # Home page
│   ├── about/page.tsx     # About page with team info
│   ├── contact/page.tsx   # Contact form page
│   ├── projects/page.tsx  # Projects showcase
│   ├── services/page.tsx  # Services overview
│   ├── workshops/page.tsx # Educational workshops
│   └── api/              # API routes
│       └── contact/      # Contact form API endpoint
├── components/
│   ├── animations/        # Framer Motion animation components
│   ├── navigation/        # Navigation components
│   ├── ui/               # shadcn/ui components (optimized with Next.js Image)
│   ├── CallToAction.tsx  # Reusable CTA component
│   ├── ErrorBoundary.tsx # Error boundary component
│   ├── Hero.tsx          # Hero section component (server component)
│   ├── HeroAnimations.tsx # Hero animations (client component)
│   ├── ServiceInquiryForm.tsx # Form with Zod validation and error handling
│   ├── ServiceTabs.tsx   # Service tabs (server component)
│   ├── ServiceTabsInteractive.tsx # Service tabs interactions (client component)
│   └── ThemeToggle.tsx   # Light/dark mode toggle
├── hooks/
│   └── useErrorHandler.ts # Custom error handling hooks
└── lib/
    ├── api-client.ts     # Enhanced API client with error handling
    ├── errors.ts         # Custom error types and utilities
    ├── types.ts          # Centralized type definitions
    ├── type-utils.ts     # TypeScript utility functions
    ├── image-optimization.ts # Image optimization utilities
    ├── seo.ts            # SEO configuration and structured data
    ├── utils.ts          # Utility functions
    ├── content/          # Content management utilities
    ├── content-*.ts      # Content management modules
    ├── pricing-data.ts   # Pricing configuration
    ├── services-data.ts  # Services configuration
    └── typescript-guide.md # TypeScript best practices guide
```

## Key Configuration Files
- [package.json](mdc:package.json) - Dependencies and scripts
- [tsconfig.json](mdc:tsconfig.json) - TypeScript configuration with path aliases
- [components.json](mdc:components.json) - shadcn/ui configuration
- [eslint.config.mjs](mdc:eslint.config.mjs) - ESLint configuration
- [next.config.ts](mdc:next.config.ts) - Next.js configuration

## Path Aliases
- `@/*` maps to `./src/*`
- `@/components` for component imports
- `@/lib` for utility functions
- `@/hooks` for custom hooks

## Pages Overview
1. **Home** (`/`): Hero, services preview, testimonials, CTA
2. **About** (`/about`): Mission, team (David Belo), approach, partnerships
3. **Services** (`/services`): AI consulting, development, education
4. **Projects** (`/projects`): Case studies and implementations
5. **Workshops** (`/workshops`): Educational programs and training
6. **Contact** (`/contact`): Contact form and information